  "item_short_desc": "<p>Unleash tactical utility and style with Rothco&rsquo;s Concealed Carry U.S. Flag Hoodie. Crafted from high-performance 100% polyester, it features a pass-through kangaroo pocket with quick access. The distressed U.S. flag print adds a patriotic touch. Sleeve details include zippered pockets for essential gear, a loop patch for morale patches, and two pen pockets. Thumbhole cuffs offer added comfort and functionality, making it the perfect blend of fashion and function for active-duty personnel.</p>",
